[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13140.309, "timestamp": "03:39:00", "text": "似たようなものは何も見つかりませんでした"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13142.07, "timestamp": "03:39:02", "text": "オンライン。 「なんてこった」って感じ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13144.229, "timestamp": "03:39:04", "text": "まず最初にそのことを聞いたとき、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13145.13, "timestamp": "03:39:05", "text": "私はそれが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13146.429, "timestamp": "03:39:06", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13149.349, "timestamp": "03:39:09", "text": "詐欺。冗談抜きで、「ふむ、それは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13151.15, "timestamp": "03:39:11", "text": "詐欺のように、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13153.99, "timestamp": "03:39:13", "text": "男。」なぜなら彼らはAIアートと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13156.21, "timestamp": "03:39:16", "text": "そういう類のことです。私は「わかった、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13158.349, "timestamp": "03:39:18", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 13160.499, "timestamp": "03:39:20", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/KsIfY6LzFoLM6AKanYDQAg"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13161.75, "timestamp": "03:39:21", "text": "わかった。「まずAIアートを見て、次に"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13165.269, "timestamp": "03:39:25", "text": "YouTubeの登録者数を見て、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13167.59, "timestamp": "03:39:27", "text": "彼らの考え方やその他諸々に合わせる。私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13169.269, "timestamp": "03:39:29", "text": "「何か怪しいことが起こっている」"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13181.67, "timestamp": "03:39:41", "text": "だって彼らは、えーと実際の声を持ってるから"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13189.51, "timestamp": "03:39:49", "text": "つまり、彼らには正当な手続きがあるということだ。でも私はそうは思わない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13190.269, "timestamp": "03:39:50", "text": "知る"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13193.15, "timestamp": "03:39:53", "text": "誰が資金提供しているのか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13195.83, "timestamp": "03:39:55", "text": "これ。そして、もしそうなら、なぜ彼らは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13197.309, "timestamp": "03:39:57", "text": "それをこのように行う"}]